{"speciesId":709,"names":{"fr":"Desséliande","es":"Trevenant","en":"Trevenant","ja":"オーロット"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Commande aux autres arbres. Il emprisonne jusqu’à la fin de leurs jours les humains qui abîment la forêt."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Puede controlar los árboles a su voluntad. Retiene hasta el fin de sus días a los humanos que se adentran en el bosque y lo mancillan."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It can control trees at will. It will trap people who harm the forest, so they can never leave."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ほかの 木々を 自在に 操る。 森を 荒らす 人間は 死ぬまで 森から 出られないようにするのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses racines sont un véritable système nerveux qui lui permet de contrôler les arbres de la forêt. Il se montre très gentil envers les Pokémon vivant dans son écorce."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus raíces le permiten controlar los árboles del bosque, al funcionar como un sistema nervioso. Es amable con los Pokémon que habitan su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Using its roots as a nervous system, it controls the trees in the forest. It’s kind to the Pokémon that reside in its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"根っこを 神経の かわりにして 森の 木を 操る。体に 住みついた ポケモンには 親切。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Commande aux autres arbres. Il emprisonne jusqu’à la fin de leurs jours les humains qui abîment la forêt."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Puede controlar los árboles a su voluntad. Retiene hasta el fin de sus días a los humanos que se adentran en el bosque y lo mancillan."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It can control trees at will. It will trap people who harm the forest, so they can never leave."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ほかの 木々を 自在に 操る。 森を 荒らす 人間は 死ぬまで 森から 出られないようにするのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses racines sont un véritable système nerveux qui lui permet de contrôler les arbres de la forêt. Il se montre très gentil envers les Pokémon vivant dans son écorce."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus raíces le permiten controlar los árboles del bosque, al funcionar como un sistema nervioso. Es amable con los Pokémon que habitan su cuerpo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Using its roots as a nervous system, it controls the trees in the forest. It’s kind to the Pokémon that reside in its body."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"根っこを 神経の かわりにして 森の 木を 操る。体に 住みついた ポケモンには 親切。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"On raconte que ce Pokémon mange tous ceux qui s’en prennent à sa forêt. Il est toutefois très gentil avec ses voisins sylvains."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es amable con los seres que habitan los bosques, pero se cuenta que devora a quienes los mancillan."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"This Pokémon is said to devour anyone daring to ravage the forest. To the creatures dwelling in the forest, it offers great kindness."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"森を 荒らす者を 喰ってしまうと いわれる ポケモン。 森に 暮らす 生き物たちには とても 優しい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Grâce à ses racines, il contrôle les arbres de la forêt où il a élu refuge, et maudit quiconque a le malheur de les abattre."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Controla los árboles con sus raíces. Si alguien tala un árbol en los bosques en los que habita, será maldecido de por vida."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Through its roots, it exerts control over other trees. A deadly curse falls upon anyone cutting down trees in forests where Trevenant dwell."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"根っ子を 通じて 他の 木々を 操る。 オーロットの 棲む 森で 木を 切ると 呪い 殺される。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les bûcherons n’entrent pas dans les bois sans Pokémon Feu, effrayés par cette créature considérée comme un fantôme sylvestre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se cree que es un demonio del bosque. Los leñadores solo se adentran llevando consigo Pokémon de tipo Fuego, a los que detesta."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s feared as a ghost of the forest. Lumberjacks bring along Fire types, which Trevenant hates, when they enter the forest."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"森の 化け物と 恐れられる。 木こりたちは オーロットが 嫌う ほのおタイプを連れ 森に 入る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il contrôle les arbres environnants grâce aux racines qui poussent au bout de ses pieds, et attaque quiconque saccage la forêt."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon controla a los árboles alargando las raíces que surgen de sus pies, para así plantar cara a quienes perjudican el bosque."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This Pokémon controls trees via roots stretching from its feet, and it will attack anyone that dares to ravage the forest."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"足の 先から 伸ばした 根っこで 近くの 木々を 操り 森を 荒らす者を 襲う ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les bûcherons qui viennent couper des arbres en forêt ont peur d’être dévorés par Desséliande. Il est gentil avec les Pokémon habitant les bois."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Los humanos lo temen porque devora a quienes osen talar los árboles, pero es amable con los Pokémon que habitan en el bosque."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"People fear it due to a belief that it devours any who try to cut down trees in its forest, but to the Pokémon it shares its woods with, it’s kind."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"森の 木を 伐り倒す 人間を 食べると 恐れられているが 森で 暮らす ポケモンたちには 優しい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il étire les fines racines de ses pieds pour établir une connexion avec les autres arbres de la forêt et ainsi les contrôler."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Puede extender las finas raíces que le brotan de las extremidades inferiores para conectarse con el resto de los árboles y controlarlos a voluntad."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Small roots that extend from the tips of this Pokémon’s feet can tie into the trees of the forest and give Trevenant control over them."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"足の 先から 細い 根っこを 伸ばして 森の 木々と 結びつき 自在に 操る 力を もつ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":709,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[25,"egg",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[15,"level-up",23],[16,"level-up",23],[17,"level-up",23],[18,"level-up",23],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"growth","learns":[[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"night-shade","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"doub